# Copy to devices.csv and list your device management addresses.
# devices.csv is gitignored. Import it with:
#   ./import_ips.py --config snmp-inventory.conf --csv devices.csv --dry-run
#
# `address` is the only required column. A mask is optional — without one the
# mask of the containing prefix in NetBox is used.
#
# There is no site column on purpose. The site comes from the prefix the
# address falls inside, so create your prefixes and scope them to sites first.
address,dns_name,description
10.10.1.5,core-sw-01.example.net,Building A core stack
10.10.1.6,,Building A access stack
10.10.1.20/24,fw-edge-01.example.net,Palo Alto edge pair
10.20.0.9,,Dallas WLC
10.20.0.10,,Dallas ClearPass
